  m_text: "Seven chests you see, all standing in a line,\nBut only four hold the
    keys you seek to find.\nChoose wisely, for the others are bare,\nUnlock the wrong
    one, and you\u2019ll find despair.\nWhat lies within may set you free,\nCan you
    solve the riddle and claim the key?"
