MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1830279190}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7da76348f51840f44b66e5c73f635a15, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialoguePanel: {fileID: 1914603732}
  dialogueText: {fileID: 984979603}
  dialogueLines:
  - 'What?! Someone else has been here before... and went missing after investigating
    this place? '
  - Does that mean there are people still living here? What kind of twisted person
    would stay in a mansion like this after the infamous murders?  (he paces a bit,
    his curiosity growing)
  - "Now I\u2019m even more intrigued. What\u2019s the real story behind this place?
    I need to dig deeper... figure out what\u2019s really going on here.  (glances
    at his communicator, frustrated)"
  - But how am I supposed to report all of this to Mr. Abraham if the connection
    is jammed? It's like this place is cut off from the outside world.  (determined,
    with a slight smirk)
  - "Well, once I make it out of here, I\u2019m definitely asking Mr. Abraham for
    a bigger paycheck. This place is a death trap... "
  - "Just wait, Mr. Abraham. I\u2019m not going down that easily."
  wordSpeed: 0.05
  continueButton: {fileID: 923351323}
  playerMovement: {fileID: 1492054355}
  npcSprite: {fileID: 0}
  inventoryButton: {fileID: 243690166}
  pauseButton: {fileID: 1748043774}
